            # Deletes blob at <storage_prefix>/my_app/path/foo.txt
            >>> client = storage.get_client("my_app")
            >>> client.delete("path/foo.txt")
            True

        Args:
            path: Relative directory of the blob.

        Returns:
            Whether the blob was deleted.
